    skos:inScheme <https://vocabs.sshopencloud.eu/vocabularies/oscars-eosc/> ;
    skos:prefLabel "data curation"@en .

<https://vocabs.sshopencloud.eu/vocabularies/oscars-eosc/DataInfrastructure> a skos:Concept ;
