<https://vocabs.sshopencloud.eu/vocabularies/oscars-eosc/> a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    dc:creator "OSCARS Glossaries Task Force"@en ;
    dc:description """This glossary defines a selection of concepts frequently used in the context of HE project OSCARS (https://oscars-project.eu/) and the wider ecosystem known as EOSC (European Open Science Cloud). It covers technical and organisational terms to support a shared understanding across disciplines, projects and services.

Representatives of the five science clusters provided input for the glossary. SSHOC (Social Sciences and Humanities Open Cluster) provided the technical and editorial expertise for the development and publication. Some definitions and notes build on the work of previous INFRA-EOSC projects funded under Horizon Europe. The format of the definitions is aligned with ISO standard 1024-1."""@en ;
    dc:language "English"@en ;
    dc:publisher "ACDH"@en ;
    dc:relation <https://oscars-project.eu/>,
        <https://science-clusters.eu/> ;
    dc:source "EOSC Federation Handbook v2.0 (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14999576)"@en,
        "EOSC Future Glossary (draft 2024)"@en,
        "EOSC Glossary 2020 (https://zenodo.org/records/4472643)"@en ;
    dc:subject "EOSC Federation"@en,
        "Open Science"@en,
        "research infrastructure"@en ;
    dc:title "OSCARS / EOSC Glossary"@en ;
    dct:created "2026-10-15"^^xsd:date ;
